flowchart TD
    Physical[Existing Dispatch actual HQ drop] --> Ledger[Physical HQ stock and manifest.unloaded commit]
    Ledger --> Clock[Existing synchronous military assessment may run]
    Ledger --> Credit[Later existing RearLogistics receipt credit]
    Credit --> New{unloaded exceeds credited?}
    New -->|no| Quiet[No new invalidation]
    New -->|yes| Commit[Commit delivered and credited together]
    Commit --> Current{Weak source matches current model policy?}
    Current -->|no| Notify[Existing changed notification]
    Current -->|yes| Invalidate[Erase only this supply type publication key]
    Invalidate --> Notify
    Invalidate --> Normal[Next eligible existing military assessment]
    Normal --> Coverage[Read current need courier local incoming and HQ coverage]
    Coverage --> Coalesce[Existing enabled per-type request coalescing]
    Coalesce --> Preserve[Keep holds manual targets and physical freight rules]
